  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 404.03 Conditions of Permit",
  "priorExpiration": "1990-11-07",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 404.03 Conditions of Permit. The following conditions shall apply to all permits to construct or reconstruct a dam:\n\n(a) The permit shall be valid for 5 years from the date of issuance;\n\n(b) Work under the permit shall be completed within 5 years unless the owner has requested and received a time extension in accordance with Env-Wr 404.04;\n\n(c) All work on the dam shall comply with the approved plans and specifications, subject to design changes approved and documented in accordance with Env-Wr 404.05;\n\n(d) The engineer shall provide a final inspection report in accordance with Env-Wr 405.07;\n\n(e) The engineer shall certify to the department that the work was completed in accordance with the approved plans and specification and design intent as required by Env-Wr 405.08;\n\n(f) Inspections shall be performed in accordance with the plan submitted pursuant to Env-Wr 405.04;\n\n(g) The owner shall notify the department upon completion of the work in accordance with Env-Wr 405.10(a);\n\n(h) The owner shall maintain a current mailing and email address with the department;\n\n(i) The owner shall operate and maintain the structure in accordance with the written approved OMRF procedures submitted in accordance with Env-Wr 402.06(a)(8); and\n\n(j) The department shall include in the permit any other conditions necessary to ensure protection of public safety that are based on the specific design, site, and watershed.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84, EXPIRED 11-7-90\n\nNew. #5080, eff 2-22-91; rpld by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97\n\nNew. #8414, eff 8-20-0; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wr100-900.html"
